<title>MEXICO: Grupo Modelo declares share dividend.</title>
<headline>Grupo Modelo declares share dividend.</headline>
<dateline>GUADALAJARA, Mexico 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Modelo declared a 0.256 of a peso per share dividend at its annual meeting on Monday, the company said.</p>
<p>The dividend will apply to the Serie A and Serie C shares.</p>
<p>((--Guadalajara newsroom, +523 817-0397))</p>
</text>
